  "text_to_speech": "Canada is truly a hotbed for artificial intelligence in IOT Microsoft has made a number of investments in Canada so we couldn't be more proud at seeing the innovative solutions such as coal Assad that is truly transforming an industry that is white for transformation data has become the new goal there is significant value in your data connecting IOT sensors to the assets that matter most to your business allows you to automate that generation of the data by applying machine learning to your data it allows you to uncover insights providing personalized experiences or products for your customers I see three things I see one more engaged in satisfied and customers secondly you can leverage this innovation to disrupt an industry and provide a differentiated experience and finally it is about increased revenue from a deeper customer engagement you leverage that data that you collect to provide that personalized targeted product and offer and the right many MB quota soft is truly a game changer for retail and restaurant industry as it fosters better collaboration with businesses and customers",
  "text_to_speech_word_count": 181,
  "timecoded_text_to_speech": [
    {
      "end": "00:00:04.963",
      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " Canada is truly a hotbed for artificial intelligence and IoT."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:10.469",
      "start": "00:00:04.963",
      "text": " Microsoft has made a number of investments in Canada, so we couldn't be more proud to see an innovative solution such as"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:14.973",
      "start": "00:00:10.469",
      "text": " Kodysoft that is truly transforming an industry that is wide for transformation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:19.978",
      "start": "00:00:14.973",
      "text": " Data has become the new goal. There is significant value in your data."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:25.984",
      "start": "00:00:19.978",
      "text": " Connecting IoT sensors to the assets that matter most of your business allows you to automate that generation of the data."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:32.991",
      "start": "00:00:25.984",
      "text": " By applying machine learning to your data, it allows you to uncover insights, providing personalized experiences or products for your customers."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:36.995",
      "start": "00:00:32.991",
      "text": " I see three things. I see one more engage in satisfied end customers."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:42.960",
      "start": "00:00:36.995",
      "text": " Secondly, you can leverage this innovation to disrupt an industry and provide a differentiated experience."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.964",
      "start": "00:00:42.960",
      "text": " And finally, it is about increased revenue from a deeper customer engagement."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:53.971",
      "start": "00:00:46.964",
      "text": " You leverage that data that you collect to provide that personalized, targeted product and offer and the right net EMB."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:03.981",
      "start": "00:00:53.971",
      "text": " Kodysoft is truly a game changer for the retail and restaurant industry as it fosters better collaboration with businesses and customers."
